# pyright, installed here by `scripts/test-deps.sh pyright` - the language
# server this plugin's semantic tier (GM-299) drives, and a test dependency of
# this crate the same way rust-analyzer is one of plugins/rust's. Never
# committed: it is 34 MB of someone else's package, and
# `plugins/typescript/.gitignore` sets the same precedent for its own
# dependencies. Its version is pinned in that script (GM-419), which is why
# no package.json or lockfile is kept here either.
#
# It lives here rather than inside `conformance/project/` on purpose. The
# conformance kit runs a plugin against a scratch *copy* of the fixture and
# `copy_tree` skips symlinks, so an npm `.bin` directory would not survive the
# copy - and a pyright install inside the fixture would also put 5,205
# bundled typeshed stubs where the walk can see them.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
